<style>
:root{
  --brand:#5F8A8B;
  --brand-light:#7BA3A4;
  --brand-dark:#3D5C5D;
  --brand-darker:#2D4647;
  --gold:#C9A962;
  --gold-light:#E8D5A3;
  --cream:#F5EED6;
  --cream-dark:#EBE4CC;
  --cream-light:#FAF7EE;
  --stone:#3A3A3A;
  --stone-light:#6A6A6A;
  --white:#FFFFFF;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  font-family:Poppins,-apple-system,sans-serif;
  background:var(--cream);
  color:var(--stone);
  line-height:1.72;
}
h1,h2,h3{
  font-family:"Playfair Display",Georgia,serif;
  font-weight:500;
  letter-spacing:-.02em;
}
a{color:var(--brand-dark);text-decoration:underline}
.desktop-only{display:block}
.mobile-only{display:none}
.guide-nav{
  position:fixed;
  top:0;
  left:0;
  right:0;
  z-index:1000;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  padding:16px 24px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);
  backdrop-filter:blur(18px);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(61,92,93,.08);
}
.guide-nav a{
  text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:600;
}
.logo{
  font-family:"Playfair Display",Georgia,serif;
  color:var(--brand-dark);
  font-size:20px;
}
.page{
  max-width:1160px;
  margin:0 auto;
  padding:96px 24px 64px;
}
.eyebrow{
  display:inline-block;
  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.2;
  letter-spacing:.18em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  font-weight:700;
  color:var(--brand-dark);
}
.hero{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(360px,.85fr);
  gap:28px;
  align-items:stretch;
  background:linear-gradient(149deg,var(--brand-darker) 6%, var(--brand-dark) 54%, #476d6f 94%);
  color:var(--white);
  border-radius:28px;
  padding:32px;
  box-shadow:0 20px 42px rgba(45,70,71,.18);
}
.hero-copy{
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  justify-content:center;
  gap:18px;
}
.hero .eyebrow{
  color:#8db1b2;
}
.scope-pill{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  gap:8px;
  width:max-content;
  padding:8px 14px;
  border-radius:999px;
  background:rgba(201,169,98,.18);
  color:var(--gold-light);
  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.2;
  letter-spacing:.16em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  font-weight:700;
}
.hero h1{
  font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,62px);
  line-height:1.02;
  color:var(--white);
  max-width:11ch;
}
.hero-lead{
  font-size:20px;
  line-height:1.65;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,.92);
  max-width:60ch;
}
.hero-support{
  max-width:60ch;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,.76);
  font-size:15px;
}
.hero-caption{
  display:none;
  color:#d6d6ce;
  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.5;
}
.hero-actions{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  align-items:center;
  gap:16px;
}
.btn{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  min-height:52px;
  padding:14px 28px;
  border-radius:999px;
  text-decoration:none;
  font-weight:700;
  background:var(--gold);
  color:#2A2014;
  box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.16);
  border:none;
  cursor:pointer;
}
.hero-secondary{
  color:var(--gold-light);
  font-size:15px;
  line-height:1.4;
  font-weight:600;
  text-decoration:none;
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(232,213,163,.56);
  padding-bottom:2px;
}
.hero-secondary:hover{
  color:var(--white);
  border-color:var(--white);
}
.proof-rail{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:10px;
}
.proof-chip{
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  padding:8px 12px;
  border-radius:999px;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  color:var(--cream-light);
  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.2;
  font-weight:600;
}
.proof-chip--soft{
  border-color:rgba(61,92,93,.12);
  background:var(--cream-light);
  color:var(--brand-dark);
}
.hero-side{
  display:flex;
  flex-direction:column;
  gap:16px;
}
.hero-media{
  display:block;
  overflow:hidden;
  border-radius:22px;
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}
.hero-media.mobile-only{
  display:none;
}
.hero-media img{
  display:block;
  width:100%;
  aspect-ratio:16/9;
  object-fit:cover;
}
.hero-media figcaption{
  padding:10px 14px;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);
  font-size:11px;
  line-height:1.45;
}
.hero-media--mobile{
  margin-top:4px;
}
.side-panel{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);
  border-radius:22px;
  padding:22px;
}
.side-panel p,
.side-panel li{
  color:rgba(255,255,255,.84);
}
.side-panel .eyebrow{
  color:var(--gold-light);
  margin-bottom:12px;
}
.hero-stack-title{
  color:var(--white);
  font-size:30px;
  line-height:1.14;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.hero-stack-copy{
  font-size:14px;
  line-height:1.6;
  margin-bottom:16px;
}
.hero-stack-list{
  display:grid;
  gap:12px;
}
.hero-stack-row{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(88px,auto);
  gap:12px;
  align-items:center;
}
.hero-stack-text strong{
  display:block;
  color:var(--white);
  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.2;
  font-weight:700;
}
.hero-stack-text span{
  display:block;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,.74);
  font-size:10px;
  line-height:1.4;
}
.hero-stack-value{
  color:var(--gold-light);
  font-size:11px;
  line-height:1.2;
  font-weight:700;
  text-align:right;
}
.hero-stack-note{
  margin-top:16px;
  color:var(--gold-light) !important;
  font-size:12px !important;
  line-height:1.5;
}
.method-list,
.quick-list{
  list-style:none;
  display:grid;
  gap:12px;
}
.method-list li,
.quick-list li{
  position:relative;
  padding-left:18px;
  font-size:14px;
}
.method-list li::before,
.quick-list li::before{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  top:8px;
  left:0;
  width:8px;
  height:8px;
  border-radius:999px;
  background:var(--gold);
}
.hero-mobile-scope{
  display:none;
}
.hero-mobile-actions{
  display:none;
}
.section{
  margin-top:32px;
  background:var(--white);
  border-radius:24px;
  padding:30px;
  border:1px solid rgba(61,92,93,.08);
  box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(61,92,93,.06);
}
.section-intro{
  max-width:780px;
  margin-bottom:20px;
}
.section-proof-rail{
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:10px;
  margin-top:18px;
}
.section h2{
  font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,40px);
  line-height:1.08;
  color:var(--brand-dark);
  margin:10px 0 12px;
}
.section p{
  font-size:16px;
}
.section-strong{
  font-weight:700;
}
.section-caption{
  margin-top:16px;
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.55;
  color:var(--stone-light);
}
.comparison-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap:16px;
}
.comparison-card{
  background:var(--cream-light);
  border:1px solid rgba(61,92,93,.12);
  border-radius:20px;
  padding:22px 20px;
}
.comparison-label{
  display:block;
  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.2;
  letter-spacing:.14em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--brand-dark);
  font-weight:700;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.comparison-card h3{
  font-size:21px;
  line-height:1.12;
  color:var(--brand-dark);
  margin-bottom:12px;
}
.comparison-card p{
  font-size:14px;
  color:var(--stone-light);
}
.layer-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap:12px;
  margin-top:18px;
  padding:20px;
  background:var(--cream-light);
  border:1px solid rgba(61,92,93,.12);
  border-radius:20px;
}
.layer-card{
  background:var(--white);
  border:1px solid rgba(61,92,93,.12);
  border-radius:16px;
  padding:18px;
}
.layer-card h3{
  color:var(--brand-dark);
  font-size:22px;
  line-height:1.14;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.layer-card p{
  color:var(--stone-light);
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.54;
}
.mini-note{
  margin-top:14px;
  font-size:12px;
  color:var(--brand-dark);
  letter-spacing:.12em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
  font-weight:700;
}
.scenario-table-wrap{
  overflow-x:auto;
  margin-top:18px;
}
.scenario-table{
  width:100%;
  border-collapse:collapse;
  min-width:720px;
}
.scenario-table th,
.scenario-table td{
  padding:14px 16px;
  text-align:left;
  vertical-align:top;
}
.scenario-table thead th{
  background:var(--brand-dark);
  color:var(--white);
  font-size:13px;
  letter-spacing:.08em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
}
.scenario-table tbody td{
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(61,92,93,.12);
  background:var(--cream-light);
}
.scenario-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td{
  background:var(--white);
}
.scenario-cards{
  display:none;
}
.scenario-card{
  background:var(--cream-light);
  border:1px solid rgba(61,92,93,.12);
  border-radius:16px;
  padding:16px;
}
.scenario-card h3{
  font-family:Poppins,-apple-system,sans-serif;
  font-size:14px;
  font-weight:700;
  color:var(--brand-dark);
  margin-bottom:6px;
}
.scenario-card p{
  font-size:13px;
}
.scenario-card p + p{
  margin-top:10px;
}
.scenario-card-field{
  display:block;
  margin-bottom:4px;
  color:var(--brand-dark);
  font-size:11px;
  font-weight:700;
  letter-spacing:.08em;
  text-transform:uppercase;
}
.scenario-card .scenario-card-note{
  color:var(--brand-dark);
}
.fit-grid{
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.95fr) minmax(300px,.85fr);
  gap:20px;
}
.fit-card{
  background:var(--cream-light);
  border:1px solid rgba(61,92,93,.12);
  border-radius:20px;
  padding:24px;
}
.fit-card p{
  font-size:14px;
  color:var(--stone);
}
.cta-shell{
  margin-top:32px;
  background:linear-gradient(166deg,var(--brand-darker) 6%, var(--brand-dark) 94%);
  color:var(--white);
  border-radius:28px;
  padding:34px 30px;
  box-shadow:0 20px 42px rgba(45,70,71,.18);
}
.cta-shell .eyebrow{
  color:var(--gold-light);
}
.cta-shell h2{
  color:var(--white);
  margin-top:10px;
  font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,40px);
  line-height:1.08;
}
.cta-shell > p{
  color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);
  max-width:760px;
  margin-top:12px;
}
.cta-button{
  margin-top:24px;
}
.cta-note{
  margin-top:16px;
  font-size:13px !important;
  line-height:1.55 !important;
  color:var(--gold-light) !important;
  max-width:760px;
}
.method-mobile{
  display:none;
}
.footer{
  text-align:center;
  color:var(--stone-light);
  font-size:14px;
  padding:0 24px 42px;
}
@media (max-width:980px){
  .hero,
  .fit-grid{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }
  .comparison-grid{
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
  }
  .layer-grid{
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));
  }
}
@media (max-width:720px){
  .desktop-only{display:none !important}
  .mobile-only{display:block !important}
  .guide-nav{padding:12px 16px}
  .page{padding:84px 16px 48px}
  .hero,
  .section,
  .cta-shell{padding:20px}
  .hero{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
    gap:12px;
    border-radius:24px;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:38px;
    line-height:1.05;
    max-width:8ch;
  }
  .hero-lead{
    font-size:15px;
    line-height:1.6;
  }
  .hero-caption{
    display:block;
  }
  .scenario-table-wrap{
    display:none;
  }
  .hero-mobile-scope{
    display:flex;
    margin-top:16px;
  }
  .hero-mobile-actions{
    display:grid;
    gap:10px;
    margin-top:10px;
  }
  .hero-mobile-actions .btn{
    width:100%;
  }
  .hero-mobile-actions .hero-secondary{
    width:max-content;
    color:var(--brand-dark);
    border-color:rgba(61,92,93,.32);
  }
  .scenario-cards{
    display:grid;
    gap:12px;
  }
  .layer-grid{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
    padding:0;
    background:none;
    border:none;
    gap:12px;
  }
  .comparison-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
    gap:12px;
  }
  .fit-grid{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }
  .section-caption{
    font-size:12px;
  }
  .method-mobile{
    display:block;
  }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav class="guide-nav">
  <a href="/research/">← Research</a>
  <span class="logo">Seascape Vacations</span>
</nav>

<main class="page">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Gulf Coast Owner Fee Guide</span>
      <span class="scope-pill desktop-only">{{ benchmark.scopeLabel }}</span>
      <h1>What Do Vacation Rental Fees Actually Cost?</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">Published platform fees are easy to find but hard to compare. Here is what Airbnb and Stripe say they charge today, from their own pricing pages — and why a full-service management fee is a different kind of number, set per property by your agreement.</p>
      <p class="hero-support desktop-only"><strong>For homeowners around Anna Maria Island, Bradenton, and Sarasota:</strong> put each charge beside the service it buys before you sign or renew.</p>
      <p class="hero-caption mobile-only">Airbnb, card processing, and property management cover different services. Compare the terms, not only the percentages.</p>
      <figure class="hero-media hero-media--mobile mobile-only">
        <picture>
          <source srcset="/images/owner-field-hero.webp" type="image/webp">
          <img src="/images/owner-field-hero.webp" alt="Gulf Coast rental homes near the Anna Maria Island and Bradenton market" width="1200" height="675" loading="eager" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">
        </picture>
        <figcaption>Local Gulf Coast management decisions should compare the service behind each charge, not just the percentage.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="hero-actions desktop-only">
        <a class="btn" href="{{ ctaPath }}" data-track-event="owner_primary_cta_click" data-page-slug="owner-fee-revenue-leak-benchmark-2026">Request Your Revenue Review</a>
        <a class="hero-secondary" href="#published-fees">Compare published fees</a>
      </div>
      <div class="proof-rail desktop-only">
        {% for label in proofLabels %}
        <span class="proof-chip">{{ label }}</span>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-side desktop-only">
      <figure class="hero-media">
        <picture>
          <source srcset="/images/owner-field-hero.webp" type="image/webp">
          <img src="/images/owner-field-hero.webp" alt="Gulf Coast rental homes near the Anna Maria Island and Bradenton market" width="1200" height="675" loading="eager" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">
        </picture>
        <figcaption>Local Gulf Coast management decisions should compare the service behind each charge, not just the percentage.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="side-panel">
        <span class="eyebrow">Published pricing quick read</span>
        <h2 class="hero-stack-title">Three charges, three different jobs</h2>
        <p class="hero-stack-copy">Use the published rates as definitions, then ask what your property-specific management quote includes.</p>
        <div class="hero-stack-list">
          {% for row in heroStackRows %}
          <div class="hero-stack-row">
            <div class="hero-stack-text">
              <strong>{{ row.title }}</strong>
              <span>{{ row.detail }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-stack-value">{{ row.value }}</div>
          </div>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <p class="hero-stack-note">These figures are definitions, not an owner-payout forecast.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="side-panel">
        <span class="eyebrow">How to use this guide</span>
        <ul class="method-list">
          {% for note in methodNotes %}
          <li>{{ note }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="hero-mobile-scope mobile-only">
    <span class="proof-chip proof-chip--soft">{{ benchmark.scopeLabel }}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-mobile-actions mobile-only">
    <a class="btn" href="{{ ctaPath }}" data-track-event="owner_primary_cta_click" data-page-slug="owner-fee-revenue-leak-benchmark-2026">Request Your Revenue Review</a>
    <a class="hero-secondary" href="#published-fees">Compare published fees</a>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">Start with the right question</span>
      <h2>A percentage only makes sense when you know what it buys.</h2>
      <p>An Airbnb host service fee pays for a booking platform. A card-processing charge pays for a transaction. A management fee pays for the work defined in your agreement. Put each number beside its service before you compare proposals.</p>
      <p class="section-strong">Ask about the fee basis, included work, and separate charges in writing.</p>
      <div class="section-proof-rail">
        <span class="proof-chip proof-chip--soft">Property-specific management pricing</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="comparison-grid">
      {% for card in comparisonCards %}
      <article class="comparison-card">
        <span class="comparison-label">{{ card.label }}</span>
        <h3>{{ card.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ card.copy }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="section-caption">The lowest percentage is not automatically the lowest total cost or the best operating fit.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">What each charge covers</span>
      <h2>Separate the transaction from the work around it.</h2>
      <p>Card processing is one line item. A direct reservation can also require software, marketing, guest support, refund handling, and local operations. For a fuller owner-income review, pair this guide with <a href="/property-management/maximize-vacation-rental-income-florida/">the Gulf Coast owner-income guide</a>, <a href="/property-management/vacation-rental-management-fees-florida/">the management-fee quote guide</a>, and the <a href="/property-management/vacation-rental-licensing-florida/">Florida vacation rental licensing and DBPR rules</a> that decide whether a home can legally earn at all.</p>
      <div class="section-proof-rail">
        <span class="proof-chip proof-chip--soft">Compare services before percentages</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="layer-grid">
      {% for layer in feeLayers %}
      <article class="layer-card">
        <h3>{{ layer.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ layer.copy }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="mini-note">Airbnb says its host service fee is calculated on the booking subtotal, including nightly price and host-set fees. Check the payout details for the charge on a specific reservation.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="published-fees">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">Published fees</span>
      <h2>Put the rates side by side, with their limits in view.</h2>
      <p>These published figures answer what Airbnb and Stripe charge for their own services. Your Seascape management price comes from the property and the signed agreement.</p>
      <div class="section-proof-rail">
        <span class="proof-chip proof-chip--soft">Published platform pricing</span>
        <span class="proof-chip proof-chip--soft">{{ benchmark.refreshedLabel }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="scenario-table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Published fee comparison" tabindex="0">
      <table class="scenario-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>What you pay</th>
            <th>Published rate or quote</th>
            <th>What it covers</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for row in publishedFeeRows %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ row.title }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.rate }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.coverage }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="scenario-cards scenario-cards--fees" data-mobile-fee-comparison>
      {% for row in publishedFeeRows %}
      <article class="scenario-card" data-mobile-fee-row>
        <h3>{{ row.title }}</h3>
        <p><span class="scenario-card-field">Published rate or quote</span><strong>{{ row.rate }}</strong></p>
        <p class="scenario-card-note"><span class="scenario-card-field">What it covers</span>{{ row.coverage }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="mini-note">{{ benchmark.sourceNote }} See <a href="https://www.airbnb.com/help/article/1857">Airbnb's service-fee page</a> and <a href="https://stripe.com/pricing">Stripe's pricing page</a> for the current terms.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">Questions for your quote</span>
      <h2>Put one question beside every number.</h2>
      <p>A clear proposal should explain the charge, the revenue base, the included service, and the costs that remain outside the agreement.</p>
      <div class="section-proof-rail">
        <span class="proof-chip proof-chip--soft">Property-specific review</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="scenario-table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Questions to compare fee quotes" tabindex="0">
      <table class="scenario-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Cost</th>
            <th>What to ask</th>
            <th>Why it matters</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for row in scenarioRows %}
          <tr>
            <td>{{ row.title }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.change }}</td>
            <td>{{ row.implication }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="scenario-cards">
      {% for row in scenarioRows %}
      <article class="scenario-card">
        <h3>{{ row.title }}</h3>
        <p><span class="scenario-card-field">What to ask</span>{{ row.change }}</p>
        <p class="scenario-card-note"><span class="scenario-card-field">Why it matters</span>{{ row.implication }}</p>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="mini-note">A property-specific review should use your statement and agreement. This checklist does not estimate revenue or promise a payout.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">Sources and review</span>
      <h2>Where these numbers come from.</h2>
      <p><strong>By {{ benchmark.reviewedBy }}</strong>, {{ benchmark.reviewerRole }}. Updated {{ benchmark.updatedDateLabel }}.</p>
      <p><strong>Basis:</strong> {{ benchmark.basis }}.</p>
      <p><strong>Source note:</strong> {{ benchmark.sourceNote }}</p>
      <ul class="quick-list" style="margin-top:18px">
        {% for source in benchmark.sources %}
        <li><a href="{{ source.url }}">{{ source.label }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <p class="section-caption">Earlier versions of this page included Seascape portfolio figures that are no longer current enough to publish. Those figures have been removed.</p>
      <div class="section-proof-rail">
        <span class="proof-chip proof-chip--soft">{{ benchmark.dataPeriod }}</span>
        <span class="proof-chip proof-chip--soft">{{ benchmark.scopeLabel }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">Who this guide is for</span>
      <h2>Gulf Coast owners who want the quote explained in writing.</h2>
      <p><a href="/property-management/">Seascape property management</a> works with owners who want a property-specific agreement, strong guest care, local follow-through, and plain-English owner updates.</p>
      <div class="section-proof-rail">
        <span class="proof-chip proof-chip--soft">{{ benchmark.scopeLabel }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fit-grid">
      <article class="fit-card">
        <span class="eyebrow">Best Fit</span>
        <ul class="quick-list">
          {% for bullet in fitBullets %}
          <li>{{ bullet }}</li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="fit-card">
        <span class="eyebrow">Pricing boundary</span>
        <p>Seascape does not publish one percentage for every property. The quote depends on the home, calendar, operating needs, and services written into the agreement.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-shell">
    <span class="eyebrow">Private revenue review</span>
    <h2>Want the same comparison for your home?</h2>
    <p>Send the listing URL, owner statement, fee quote, or property address. Seascape will show which charges are clear, which terms deserve a closer look, and what to ask before you renew or switch.</p>
    <a class="btn cta-button" href="{{ ctaPath }}" data-track-event="owner_primary_cta_click" data-page-slug="owner-fee-revenue-leak-benchmark-2026">Request Your Revenue Review</a>
    <p class="cta-note">Every home is different. Tell us about your property and we will explain what management would cost before you commit.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section method-mobile mobile-only">
    <div class="section-intro" style="margin-bottom:0">
      <span class="eyebrow">How to use this guide</span>
      <p>Start with the published platform and payment charges, then compare them with the services and fee basis in your property-specific management agreement.</p>
      <div class="section-proof-rail">
        <span class="proof-chip proof-chip--soft">{{ benchmark.scopeLabel }}</span>
        <span class="proof-chip proof-chip--soft">{{ benchmark.refreshedLabel }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="footer">© 2026 <a href="/">Seascape Vacations</a> · <a href="/property-management/">Property Management</a> · <a href="/property-management/vacation-rental-management-fees-florida/">Management Fees</a></footer>
{% include "partials/analytics-ga4.njk" %}
</body>
</html>
